{{!-- The validity gate: an observation taken against a baseline the export no
      longer holds is never shown as a comparison. --}}
<section class="drift-superseded rounded-lg border border-amber-300 dark:border-amber-700 bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/40 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-200">
  <p class="font-semibold">This drift observation is outdated.</p>
  <p class="mt-1">
    It was observed on {{observedAt}} against the baseline of {{observationBaseline}},
    {{#if currentBaseline}}but the export now holds the baseline of {{currentBaseline}}{{else}}but the export baseline could not be determined{{/if}}.
    Its findings are not shown. Re-run <code class="font-mono">azure-rd resource drift</code> for this tenant.
  </p>
</section>
